    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A transform following GDAL's Affine Transform that transforms a local coordinate into a WGS84 coordinate. Created from Ground Control Points (GCP) using GDAL's GCPsToGeotransform method.</rdfs:comment>
